    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Cube</i> is a cooperative FPS where you and up to three friends are trapped in a high-stakes virtual heist. Tasked by an unseen patron, your mission is to infiltrate the office complex of Mr. Z, gather critical data, and escape before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is procedurally generated, with randomized floor layouts and security setups, creating fresh challenges every playthrough. The game features two unique timers: a shared mission timer and individual survival timers. As you progress, your choices and reputation with the patron influence the time you have to complete each mission. Failure is real\u2014fall behind, and you\u2019re left to face the consequences alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Floors</strong>: Navigate a unique layout on every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Timer System</strong>: Balance mission time with individual survival time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Heist Mechanics</strong>: Hack terminals, bypass security, and grab essential items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Voice Communication</strong>: Coordinate strategy with your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong>: Earn or lose time based on your performance and patron\u2019s favor.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Cube</i> is a cooperative FPS where you and up to three friends are trapped in a high-stakes virtual heist. Tasked by an unseen patron, your mission is to infiltrate the office complex of Mr. Z, gather critical data, and escape before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is procedurally generated, with randomized floor layouts and security setups, creating fresh challenges every playthrough. The game features two unique timers: a shared mission timer and individual survival timers. As you progress, your choices and reputation with the patron influence the time you have to complete each mission. Failure is real\u2014fall behind, and you\u2019re left to face the consequences alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Floors</strong>: Navigate a unique layout on every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Timer System</strong>: Balance mission time with individual survival time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Heist Mechanics</strong>: Hack terminals, bypass security, and grab essential items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Voice Communication</strong>: Coordinate strategy with your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong>: Earn or lose time based on your performance and patron\u2019s favor.</p></li></ul>",
